1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 21=

4
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,340
(Qingyan Palace)

5
00:01:21,590 --> 00:01:22,480
He Xiaoyuan.

6
00:01:23,870 --> 00:01:24,590
He Xiaoyuan.

7
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,000
Why is it you again?

8
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,790
He Xiaoyuan.

9
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:38,400
Live one more time for me.

10
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,200
As long as you survive,

11
00:01:40,710 --> 00:01:41,680
I'll stay by your side

12
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,710
and help you recover those memories.

13
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,400
That's my voice.

14
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:49,790
Why did you...

15
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:50,590
Then...

16
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:51,590
We...

17
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:53,840
Because

18
00:01:54,790 --> 00:01:56,040
during the riot
over the disaster relief,

19
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,280
I was the one who saved you.

20
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,560
I was also the one
who said goodbye to you in the ice bath.

21
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,310
From beginning to end,

22
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,840
I'm the only one you've ever loved.

23
00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:02,870
Mu Tingting

24
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,840
is nothing but a fraud
who stole our memories and love.

25
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,400
What's wrong?

26
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,480
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

27
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,770
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

28
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,590
Your Highness.

29
00:02:16,470 --> 00:02:17,400
His Majesty has summoned you urgently.

30
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:21,320
♪How much must I let go for one moment♪

31
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,630
♪To hold each other close♪

32
00:02:23,710 --> 00:02:24,680
Who dares barge in?

33
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,470
How dare you!

34
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,310
My apologies.

35
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:27,190
Forgive the intrusion, Your Highness.

36
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:27,960
His Majesty has given an order

37
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:29,280
for you to report
to the Imperial Study at once.

38
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:32,710
Understood.

39
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:33,910
You may leave.

40
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:34,630
Yes.

41
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:40,750
Stay here.

42
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,030
Don't make a sound.

43
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,800
Father.

44
00:02:54,730 --> 00:02:55,470
You unfilial son!

45
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,470
Someone reported

46
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,840
that under the guise of disaster relief,

47
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,120
you colluded
with wealthy merchants in Jianghuai,

48
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,080
embezzled government funds,

49
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,000
drove up grain prices,

50
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,080
and lined your own pockets!

51
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:05,240
Do you admit to these charges?

52
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:05,960
Father.

53
00:03:06,430 --> 00:03:07,680
I have done no such thing.

54
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:08,910
Please see the truth, Father.

55
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:10,960
This jade token

56
00:03:11,590 --> 00:03:13,680
was found in that
corrupt merchant's secret vault.

57
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,750
Father, please calm your anger.

58
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,280
Boqing is still young.

59
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:21,080
It's only natural for him
to make mistakes sometimes.

60
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,190
Father, why not

61
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,840
give him another chance?

62
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,470
Very well.

63
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,470
I'll give you three days.

64
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,590
If within three days

65
00:03:29,910 --> 00:03:31,680
you cannot prove his innocence

66
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,030
and give me a satisfactory explanation,

67
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:34,400
then I will have no choice

68
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,680
but to punish this unfilial son
according to the law.

69
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,560
I

70
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,630
obey your command.

71
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,870
His Majesty has decreed

72
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:48,870
that until the case is resolved,

73
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:50,870
the Seventh Prince
may not leave the palace.

74
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:09,120
While the palace servants
are being dismissed,

75
00:04:10,150 --> 00:04:11,430
leave Qingyan Palace

76
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,630
with the palace maids.

77
00:04:13,030 --> 00:04:14,310
Don't come back here
without good reason.

78
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,430
Being falsely accused
of embezzling military funds...

79
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:17,830
You went through this
in your last life too.

80
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,800
I can help you.

81
00:04:19,270 --> 00:04:20,600
The Yu family is behind it...

82
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,560
It's the Crown Prince.

83
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:23,040
He Xiaoyuan.

84
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,040
Everything you told me yesterday

85
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:27,160
will take time

86
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:28,870
for me to process and verify.

87
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,070
Until then,

88
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,830
if you say one more thing

89
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,630
to mislead me,

90
00:04:35,270 --> 00:04:37,680
I'll have no choice but to regard you
as an enemy, not a friend.

91
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:38,950
The Crown Prince...

92
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,600
(So this life really has changed.)

93
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:41,430
(The Crown Prince has changed.)

94
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,510
(Kind and devoted,)

95
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:43,300
(indifferent to the throne)

96
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:44,190
(was all just a facade.)

97
00:04:44,270 --> 00:04:46,000
(In this life, Yu Feilin isn't
the one causing trouble either.)

98
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,190
(Zhao Junyao has become the one)

99
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:49,070
(who most wants Zhao Boqing dead.)

100
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:49,720
(Then...)

101
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,950
(Could it be)

102
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,920
(that Mu Tingting's change in this life)

103
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:53,870
(wasn't an accident either?)

104
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:56,040
Mu Tingting.

105
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,800
It was Mu Tingting.

106
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,190
Maybe

107
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,480
she stole the jade token.

108
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:04,870
What's wrong?

109
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,480
Ever since that banquet,

110
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:15,270
I've been having frequent headaches.

111
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:16,920
Especially

112
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,310
when you talk about what happened

113
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,680
in our past lives.

114
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,480
He Xiaoyuan.

115
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,630
I really want to believe you.

116
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:27,560
But in my memories,

117
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,360
that person is clearly Mu Tingting.

118
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,160
It's Gu.

119
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:33,040
Look at this.

120
00:05:34,740 --> 00:05:36,780
(Silken Bond Love Gu: Symptoms)

121
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:37,830
Love Gu?

122
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:39,800
Can cloud a person's mind

123
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,040
and even transfer memories.

124
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,480
I asked my sister

125
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,600
to search through every ancient text
and miscellaneous book for this.

126
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,480
Zhao Boqing.

127
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:50,430
If you're willing to follow your heart

128
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,240
and trust me just once,

129
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:52,870
then put Mu Tingting to the test.

130
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,870
Your Highness.

131
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,560
I was just looking for you.

132
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,680
I'd like to hear you play the zither

133
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:11,240
for my enjoyment.

134
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,750
I'm honored, Your Highness.

135
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,040
I'll return to my room to change
and prepare my zither.

136
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:15,950
No need.

137
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:18,680
The zither table
and tea set are already prepared.

138
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,360
All that's missing is the lady herself.

139
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,310
Please.

140
00:06:37,270 --> 00:06:39,830
You seem remarkably
at ease, Your Highness.

141
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,160
Why shouldn't I be?

142
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:44,830
Right now,

143
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:46,680
the one who framed me

144
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:49,430
should be the most anxious of all.

145
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,680
Your Highness.

146
00:06:55,950 --> 00:06:57,070
Why do you say that?

147
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,000
I've always been

148
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,390
cautious and suspicious by nature.

149
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,070
That jade token

150
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:06,870
is usually coated
with Seven-Day Bone-Eroding Powder.

151
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,160
Touch it,

152
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:09,680
and the poison seeps into the skin.

153
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:11,240
At first, nothing seems amiss.

154
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,870
After two days,

155
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:17,040
the skin festers as if eaten by insects,

156
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,240
with an unbearable itch

157
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:21,240
that makes one scratch
until the flesh is raw.

158
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,190
Without an antidote within three days,

159
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,360
the internal organs will begin to rot,

160
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,600
causing an agonizing death.

161
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,600
That sounds terrifying, Your Highness.

162
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,560
Fortunately, I

163
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:39,680
have never touched that jade token.

164
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,560
It's good that you haven't touched

165
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,750
my belongings.

166
00:07:49,830 --> 00:07:51,600
But the poison
is colorless and odorless.

167
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:53,160
Only someone poisoned by it

168
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,750
would feel its effects.

169
00:08:01,190 --> 00:08:02,920
I'm suddenly feeling unwell.

170
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,480
Please excuse me.

171
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:25,920
(It seems tonight)

172
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:28,000
(I'll have to take a risk.)

173
00:08:29,460 --> 00:08:31,140
(Qingyan Palace)

174
00:09:10,150 --> 00:09:11,480
Are you looking for this?

175
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,240
Your Highness.

176
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:25,960
He Xiaoyuan.

177
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,390
Why are you here too?

178
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,600
Only you could come up

179
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:39,270
with such a childish trick.

180
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:41,240
As long as it works.

181
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:44,000
This is my sister's
latest itching powder.

182
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,390
Just wait and see.

183
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:58,200
So there was never any poison.

184
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,120
You two joined forces to trick me.

185
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:04,270
Tell me.

186
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:05,960
Who told you to steal my jade token

187
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,270
and use love Gu on me?

188
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:10,600
Zhao Boqing.

189
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,360
So the person behind her

190
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,200
was you.

191
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,440
Zhao Junyao.

192
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,960
Zhao Boqing.

193
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:30,670
It seems I still
underestimated you in this life.

194
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:33,910
You overestimated yourself.

195
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:35,200
I thought

196
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:36,670
that by getting ahead of you,

197
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:39,240
I could destroy you before you
knew what was happening.

198
00:10:39,270 --> 00:10:40,480
But I never expected

199
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:42,440
my beloved Crown Princess

200
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:45,030
to betray me like this.

201
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:46,390
Your Highness.

202
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:47,960
Xiaoyuan.

203
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,960
I gave you status,

204
00:10:52,790 --> 00:10:53,630
my heart,

205
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:56,200
and all my affection.

206
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:03,720
How am I inferior to Zhao Boqing?

207
00:11:05,030 --> 00:11:05,870
Tell me.

208
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,670
Tell me!

209
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,150
Xiaoyuan, don't be afraid.

210
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:23,960
If you're willing,

211
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,200
you can still be

212
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,870
my most beloved Crown Princess.

213
00:11:31,870 --> 00:11:33,150
I won't go with you.

214
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:39,150
Then just wait

215
00:11:40,910 --> 00:11:42,840
to see Zhao Boqing off
for the last time.

216
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:46,150
What are you going to do?

217
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:06,870
Your Highness.

218
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,150
Zhao Junyao!

219
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,600
The love Gu will consume his heart.

220
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,630
There is no cure.

221
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,000
Xiaoyuan.

222
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,550
Look carefully.

223
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:22,670
The man you chose

224
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,030
will end up dead.

225
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:27,120
Both you

226
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,390
and this realm

227
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:32,080
will be mine!

228
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:34,750
Zhao Boqing.

229
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,720
Zhao Boqing.

230
00:12:47,270 --> 00:12:48,080
Zhao Boqing.

231
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:53,480
Zhao Boqing.

232
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,860
(Qingyan Palace)

233
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,200
The love Gu afflicting His Highness

234
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,480
has reached deep into his heart.

235
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:00,960
No medicine can cure him.

236
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,550
To remove it by force,

237
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:04,440
someone must draw the Gu
into themselves in exchange for his life.

238
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:07,240
What must be done?

239
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:08,600
Someone

240
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:09,670
must use their blood as a lure

241
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:11,870
to draw the Gu into their own body.

242
00:13:12,390 --> 00:13:13,240
But

243
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,790
the Gu is extremely vicious.

244
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:17,000
The one who draws it out
will suffer a severe backlash

245
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,200
and may barely survive.

246
00:13:25,690 --> 00:13:28,590
♪Lies woven from schemes in the mire♪

247
00:13:28,590 --> 00:13:30,220
♪Have trapped our fate♪

248
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:31,150
Imperial Physician, please

249
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,270
make the preparations at once.

250
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,270
Yes.

251
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:35,420
♪The tangled knot between love and hate♪

252
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:37,570
♪Shatters beneath your blade♪

253
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:38,410
Zhao Boqing.

254
00:13:38,410 --> 00:13:41,290
♪Pear blossoms fill the courtyard,
fallen over old grievances♪

255
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:52,740
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

256
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:54,780
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

257
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:58,420
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

258
00:13:58,940 --> 00:14:03,260
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

259
00:14:03,260 --> 00:14:06,020
♪My heart has long known♪

260
00:14:06,460 --> 00:14:08,460
♪We made a promise long ago♪

261
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,380
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

262
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:14,380
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

263
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:17,540
♪How much must I let go♪

264
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:19,540
♪For one moment♪

265
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:22,540
♪To hold each other close♪

266
00:14:22,780 --> 00:14:27,100
♪Would that be enough?♪
